Z||000001||StuGood||11-07-2000||01:14 AM||||If you're talking about an identifying number on the vehicle, the sticker in front compartment has a code that tells you what  the car's OE transaxle is/was.<P>If you're comparing transaxles in a yard (not in the car), the physical features, such as shifter cable bracketry and backup light switch location provides clues.  Don't know much about any ID tags on the Fiero transaxles.    ||||reg||5
